  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Green Credits for Gender-responsive Deforestation-free and Forest-degradation-free Value Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &lt;/strong&gt;(Overall Objective): Enhanced women&apos;s rights to decent job and entrepreneurship opportunities in Green and Circular Economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;outcome 1&lt;/strong&gt;: Improved technical and operational capacity of the pioneer smallholders and women-led cooperatives for deforestation-free and forest-degradation-free production.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;outcome 2&lt;/strong&gt;: Increased access of pioneer smallholders and cooperatives to green credits for their gender-responsive agroecology value chains.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
